{"out": "S0E11_antoush", "end": "بنات، اسألوا أسئلتكن وشاركوا تجربتكن", "endsub": "Girls, ask your questions and share your story", "lines": [{"who": "Souad", "ar": "هلّق دور البنات.", "en": "Now it's the girls' turn.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.55, 1.7, 0.66, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e11_l01.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "أخيراً! كنت ناطرة دوري!", "en": "Finally! I've been waiting for my turn!", "img": "/home/claude/btbtp-media/refs/fantoush_master.jpg", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e11_l02.mp3"}, {"who": "Wadad", "ar": "لمّا الكلى بتتعب، الدورة بتخربط، ومرّات بتوقف.", "en": "When the kidneys fail, periods get irregular, and sometimes they stop.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/car/c02b.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.5, 0.58], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e11_l03.mp3"}, {"who": "Souad", "ar": "والحمل عالغسيل صعب وفيه خطر، بدّو متابعة كتير دقيقة.", "en": "Pregnancy on dialysis is hard and risky, and needs very close follow-up.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e2/aunties.png", "z": [1.0, 1.1, 0.5, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e11_l04.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "يعني خلص؟ ما في أمل؟", "en": "So that's it? No hope?", "img": "/home/claude/btbtp-media/refs/fantoush_master.jpg", "z": [1.4, 1.55, 0.5, 0.5], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e11_l05.mp3"}, {"who": "New kidney", "ar": "لأ! بعد الزراعة، الدورة والخصوبة كتير مرّات بيرجعوا. والحمل بينخطّط مع الفريق، لأنّو في أدوية لازم تتغيّر قبل.", "en": "No! After the transplant, periods and fertility often come back. Pregnancy is planned with the team, because some medicines must change first.", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/car/c02c.png", "z": [1.05, 1.2, 0.5, 0.58], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e11_l06.mp3"}, {"who": "guest", "ar": "هيدا الحكي!", "en": "Now that's what I'm talking about!", "img": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/car/c02c.png", "z": [1.3, 1.45, 0.4, 0.55], "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-claude/988431de-1e8a-5e55-a69c-1b6d3578148a/scratchpad/s0e345/e11_l07.mp3"}]}